       Check Statement 7: Snail owner (H3) dances. Yes.

       Check Statement 12: Painter (H1) next to Horse (H2). Yes.

       Check Statement 13: Football (H4) drinks Orange Juice. Yes.

       Check Statement 14: Japanese (H5) plays Chess. Yes.

       

       So:

       Water drinker: Norwegian (H1).

       Zebra owner: Japanese (H5).



